From dfdc9738e61c4c34d317c132d869b461837a9018 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Yi Xie <imxieyi@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Mon, 24 Aug 2026 12:53:11 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 23/23] UML-ANDROID-LOCAL: cuttlefish retire legacy UML product
 tree

The fresh Kernarium device overlay owns the supported UML product, board policy, SELinux labels, init, ueventd, fstab, and Virgl symlink rule. Remove the superseded lunch target and device tree instead of retaining a broken compatibility product, and stop shared Cuttlefish rules from declaring its old boot prebuilts.

Change-Id: I8cc4560bc82118272457ae19f496589076f3b0a1
